  _speaker: Therapist
  _scene: 0
  _recollection: {fileID: 0}
  _lines:
  - Of course!
  - 'Today is intake, so we''re gonna start with a couple questions so I can get
    to know you. '
  - 'This will also serve to get your starting sanity up. As we start discussing
    things more, your answers will raise or lower your sanity depending on how close
    they stray from the truth. '
  - So, it's best if we remain honest with each other. I know it's hard. But holding
    things back will only make it harder to figure things out later.
  - And if you forget anything you've described to me, I'm keeping a journal you'll
    always have access to, and you can check it to see what we've covered so far.
  - Does that make sense?
  _playerReplyOptions:
  - Yes, I think so.
  - No, can you repeat that?
